# Generated at build time from the .hcd patch data by tools/hcd2c.py.
# These files are not part of the distributed Package: the Bluetooth
# controller patch data is shipped as binary .hcd only, and the C file is
# produced locally during the build.  Keep them out of releases.
bt-fw-cywl-*/btfw.c
tools/__pycache__/
tools/*.pyc
